   <|"Data" -> "# Release notes *2.6.2*\n\n", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "1ccbc537-98c2-4469-97c5-d450aa1127da", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "7cdec12d-cc04-47e5-b01f-95057bc679a5"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> ".md\n## Better folder structure\nStarting from 2.6.2 we no \
longe use application data directory for storing notebooks and your backups. \
Our new structure follows the pattern\n\n<br/>\n\n- `YourDocuments/WLJS \
Notebooks/` examples and your default home folder\n- \
`$TemporalDirectory/wljs_quicknotes` folder for anonimous quick notes\n- \
`$TemporalDirectory/wljs_backups` backups folder\n\nYour current data will \
not be erased.\n\nAlso we moved all offline documentation to a separate \
system package.", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "8cfd5c8b-1066-46aa-a295-91957490a10f", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "7cdec12d-cc04-47e5-b01f-95057bc679a5"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "## Better folder structure\nStarting from 2.6.2 we no longe \
use application data directory for storing notebooks and your backups. Our \
new structure follows the pattern\n\n<br />\n\n- `YourDocuments/WLJS \
Notebooks/` examples and your default home folder\n- \
`$TemporalDirectory/wljs_quicknotes` folder for anonimous quick notes\n- \
`$TemporalDirectory/wljs_backups` backups folder\n\nYour current data will \
not be erased.\n\nAlso we moved all offline documentation to a separate \
system package.", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "cacad560-8a45-4011-88e4-0c99e9d3c3db", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <||>, "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, 
    "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Output", "UID" -> Null, 
    "Notebook" -> "7cdec12d-cc04-47e5-b01f-95057bc679a5"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> ".md\n## Safer Synchronization and Uploading\n\nIf you have a \
large file added to a cell or heavy objects loaded to the frontend, it could \
crash the master kernel upon saving due to buffering issues. Now it is split \
into smaller parts, which prevents buffer overflow and allows for easy \
progress tracking.\n\nYou will notice this indication when saving a notebook \
with many images.", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "ed8f3acc-9400-4631-8dc1-2f3c83299699", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
    "PublicFields" -> {"Properties"}, "State" -> "Idle", "Type" -> "Input", 
    "UID" -> Null, "Notebook" -> "7cdec12d-cc04-47e5-b01f-95057bc679a5"|>, 
   <|"Data" -> "## Safer Synchronization and Uploading\n\nIf you have a large \
file added to a cell or heavy objects loaded to the frontend, it could crash \
the master kernel upon saving due to buffering issues. Now it is split into \
smaller parts, which prevents buffer overflow and allows for easy progress \
tracking.\n\nYou will notice this indication when saving a notebook with many \
images.", "Display" -> "markdown", "Hash" -> 
